    "_note": "Deity-names are fused morphs of the Agrippan canon (Hellenic + Plains), never real Greek/Plains gods. Thracan seeds/shifts Lawful or Chaotic; its stance follows its CURRENT alignment (see worship_by_alignment). The powers are met in the mystery-rite and the vision-quest, under the open sky and at the kurgan-tomb; the war-king is initiate and war-leader both.",
