      "7": "Archmystos (high initiate)",
      "9": "Megas-Hierophnaika (the war-king's great seer)"
    },
    "demon_epithet_pattern": "the demonized set (by current alignment) take dread epithets: when Lawful - Maraxus -> Maraksios the War-Fire, Dementus -> Tamawios the Mad-Storm; when Chaotic - Tulrius -> Toravios the Cold-Sun, Aeternus -> Aiterunos the Sky-Tyrant.",
    "holy_symbol_motifs": {
      "Maraksios": "a bronze spear and horsetail-standard beneath a thunder-cloud",
      "Tamawios": "the forked storm over the grass-sea",
      "Toravios": "a radiate sun above a galloping horse"
    },
    "religious_orders_pattern": "the Tem-shinato (mystery-precinct and sacred cairn) of [power] on the high ground: 'the Tem-shinato of Maraksios', and the vision-rite of the riders.",
